**DIRAC
.TITLE
  MgF
.WAVE F ! Activate integral and wave functions modules
#.PROPERTIES ! Activate property module (dipole moment; polarizability...)
.ANALYZE
.4INDEX
**GENERAL
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
1
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
2
*READIN
.UNCONTRACTED
**HAMILTONIAN
.PRINT
2
!.ONESYS
.INTFLG
1 1 0
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.SCF
*SCF
.CLOSED SHELL
20  
.OPEN SHELL
1
1/2
.INTFLG ! Specify what 2-el.integrals to include
1 1 0
.EVCCNV ! Energy convergence...
1.0D-8  1.0D-6
#################################################
**ANALYZE
.MULPOP
*MULPOP
.VECPOP
1..28
**MOLTRA
.SCHEME
6
# take shells of interest - here all OCCUPIED SHELLS
.ACTIVE
1..11
.PRPTRA
*PRPTRA
# we need this print level to get desired matrix elements
.PRINT
3
.OPERATOR
 'e_EDM x F' 
 XSIGMA
 'NEF 001'
 COMFACTOR
 2.00D0
.OPERATOR
 'e_EDM y F' 
 YSIGMA
 'NEF 002'
 COMFACTOR
 2.00D0
.OPERATOR
 'e_EDM z F' 
 ZSIGMA
 'NEF 003'
 COMFACTOR
 2.00D0
.OPERATOR
 'e_EDM x Mg' 
 XSIGMA
 'NEF 004'
 COMFACTOR
 2.00D0
.OPERATOR
 'e_EDM y Mg' 
 YSIGMA
 'NEF 005'
 COMFACTOR
 2.00D0
.OPERATOR
 'e_EDM z Mg' 
 ZSIGMA
 'NEF 006'
 COMFACTOR
 2.00D0
*END OF
